# A world's wait_all and wait_any: wait_all ends once every entry is over, wait_any once one is.
# Seconds of world time from now, each an entry.
float64[] seconds
# Executing action goals, each an entry that is over once the goal has finished.
unique_identifier_msgs/UUID[] goals
# Seconds of world time after which the wait ends whatever is left; zero for no limit.
float64 timeout
---
bool success
string message
# World time when the wait ended.
float64 time_s
# Whether each of seconds and each of goals was over when the wait ended, in their order.
bool[] elapsed
bool[] finished
# The wait ended at its timeout, with entries left.
bool timed_out
